  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rebuilding Social and Economic Connections between Northeast Syria Returnees and Communities in Iraq (RECONNECT)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Over the last two years, with support from the European Union (RISE project) and additional contributions from SIDA, the United States, Italy, and the Netherlands (CRRISA project), UNDP has facilitated the reintegration of 4,738 individuals. This includes 2,461 returnees (1,556 female, 901 male and 177 persons with disability), alongside vulnerable community members. Building on the achievements and lessons learned, the proposed Rebuilding Social and Economic Connections Between Northeast Syria</narrative>
  </description>
